substitute for the theorem aliases above: `proved` and `correctedAndProved`
refer to kernel-checked declarations.  Its disposition type has exactly the
three terminal states permitted by the certification objective; unsupported
literal steps carry a concrete `removedWithErratum` witness through
`RequirementEvidence`. -/

